rootkit-flagged-title = A rootkit scanner flagged something
rootkit-flagged-summary = { $tool } reported: { $text }. This is a lead for a person to check, not proof: both scanners often raise false alarms after a package update.
rootkit-may-affect-load = The scan reads most of the system and can slow the computer while it runs.
detect-rootkit-title = Rootkit scanners on this computer
detect-rootkit-none = Neither rkhunter nor chkrootkit is installed. IbexWall installs nothing; to get rkhunter, run: { $install }
detect-rootkit-ready = { $tools } is installed and has not run through IbexWall yet. You can scan now or on a schedule.
detect-rootkit-scanned = A scan has run. What it flagged is listed above; nothing flagged means the scanners found nothing to report.
